{"version":1,"id":"oliver-anthony-rich-men-north-of-richmond","title":"Rich Men North of Richmond","artist":"Oliver Anthony","key":"Em","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/oliver-anthony/rich-men-north-of-richmond/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Christopher Anthony Lunsford","chords":[{"symbol":"Em","canonical":"Em","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,7,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"I've been selling my soul, working all day","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Overtime hours, for bullshit pay","columns":32,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":20,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"So I can sit out here, and waste my life away","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Drag back home, and drown my troubles away","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"It's a damn shame, what the world's gotten to","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"For people like me, and people like you","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Wish I could just wake up, and it not be true","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":35,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"But it is, aw it is","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":17,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Livin' in the new world, with an old soul","columns":44,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":24,"beat":2},{"symbol":"G","column":33,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D","column":43,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"These rich men north of Richmond, Lord knows they all","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Just wanna have total control","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Wanna know what you think, wanna know what you do","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":21,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":47,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"And they don't think you know, but I know that you do","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":25,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":51,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause your dollar ain't shit, and it's taxed to no end","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":25,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":52,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause of rich men, north of Richmond","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"instrumental","text":"(             )","columns":15,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":6,"beat":2},{"symbol":"G","column":9,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D","column":12,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"I wish politicians would look out for miners","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"And not just minors on an island somewhere","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Lord, we got folks in the street, ain't got nothin' to eat","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"And the obese, milkin' welfare","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"But God, if you're five foot three and you're three hundred pounds","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":20,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":47,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Taxes ought not to pay for your bags of fudge rounds","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Young men are puttin' themselves six feet in the ground","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause all this damn country does, is keep on kickin' them down","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":46,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Lord, it's a damn shame, what the world's gotten to","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Em","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","c